    Simple... the compound selbri "sutra je jipci" doesn't HAVE an x2 place
(but it does have both an s2 and j2 place which have to be internally
linked with be), similar to the way that a lujvo may not have all the
places that the underlying veljvo seltau jonai tertau have.

       I don't know why this is a such a problem for you.  This is as
specious as saying you can never have a heterosexual woman President of the
United States, since then the phrase "first lady" would have no meaning.

                    --gejyspa



